{
  "description": "How a preview opens and how a list or several links start (issue #4). A link opens on Video or Audio from the default preset, the kind of link and the music-videos setting; MP3 always starts at 320 (one song, a list, several links), every other audio format at Best. A YouTube link that is not treated as music opens as a video whatever the default preset says. A list or several links apply one preset: MP3 is 320 there too.",
